{
  "id": "wf-diagnose",
  "displayName": "诊断 · 缺陷修复",
  "description": "诊断缺陷修复正式模板：缺陷诊断 → 修复 → 审核 → 回归验证 → 收口；先诊断后修复，原始 feedback signal 贯穿全程；修复问题回修复、证据推翻根因回诊断（均消耗自动回退额度，默认 3）；证据不足且不可复现时受阻，不猜根因；默认无独立人工验收节点。",
  "entry": "diagnose",
  "control": {
    "maxRounds": 3
  },
  "heteroCheck": "weak",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "diagnose",
      "profile": "diagnose",
      "label": "缺陷诊断",
      "goal": "从冻结 Source 开始诊断缺陷：以原始 feedback signal 为线索，先复现、再定位根因，产出根因结论与证据链（含 verified_head 锚定的复现输入与观察输出），写入 `diagnosis-report.md`。证据不足且不可复现时输出 BLOCKED（不猜根因，如实写明缺失的证据与复现尝试）；根因明确则输出 DIAGNOSED。最终回复只输出本节点 schema 对应 JSON。",
      "output": {
        "outcomePath": "$.route",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "route": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "DIAGNOSED",
                "BLOCKED"
              ]
            },
            "root_cause": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "evidence": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "verified_head": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "route",
            "root_cause",
            "evidence",
            "verified_head"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "files": {
          "diagnosis-report.md": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fix",
      "profile": "dev",
      "label": "修复",
      "goal": "只针对诊断结论（`diagnosis-report.md`）的根因修复，以原始 feedback signal 为验收基准做最小必要修改，不得顺手扩大范围；修复必须可被证据链解释（修改点与根因对应）。外部条件无法安全继续时输出 BLOCKED；否则输出 FIXED。将修复交接写入 `fix-report.md`；最终回复只输出本节点 schema 对应 JSON。",
      "output": {
        "outcomePath": "$.route",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "route": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "FIXED",
                "BLOCKED"
              ]
            },
            "summary": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "changed": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "route",
            "summary",
            "changed"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "files": {
          "fix-report.md": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "review",
      "profile": "review",
      "label": "审核",
      "goal": "对照 `diagnosis-report.md` 与 `fix-report.md` 审核修复：修改是否与根因对应、是否最小、原始 feedback signal 场景是否被覆盖、是否引入新问题。结论四选一：APPROVE（通过，交回归验证）/ FIX_ISSUES（修复本身有问题，退修复）/ ROOT_CAUSE_REFUTED（审核证据推翻根因结论，回缺陷诊断）/ BLOCKED。不得代行修复。最终回复只输出本节点 schema 对应 JSON。",
      "output": {
        "outcomePath": "$.route",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "route": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "APPROVE",
                "FIX_ISSUES",
                "ROOT_CAUSE_REFUTED",
                "BLOCKED"
              ]
            },
            "verdict_reason": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "route",
            "verdict_reason"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "files": {
          "review-report.md": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "regression",
      "profile": "test",
      "label": "回归验证",
      "goal": "以原始 feedback signal 为第一回归输入验证修复：缺陷场景不再复现，且既有行为无回归（运行与修改相关的既有测试）。结论四选一：PASS（回归通过，交收口）/ FIX_ISSUES（修复未生效或引入新问题，退修复）/ ROOT_CAUSE_REFUTED（回归证据推翻根因结论，回缺陷诊断）/ BLOCKED。不得修改被测代码。最终回复只输出本节点 schema 对应 JSON。",
      "output": {
        "outcomePath": "$.route",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "route": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "PASS",
                "FIX_ISSUES",
                "ROOT_CAUSE_REFUTED",
                "BLOCKED"
              ]
            },
            "verdict_reason": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "regression_evidence": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "route",
            "verdict_reason",
            "regression_evidence"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "files": {
          "regression-report.md": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "closeout",
      "profile": "closeout",
      "label": "收口",
      "goal": "仅对回归验证通过的同一修复成果收口：保留诊断、修复、审核、回归四类记录，不得重新开发或改写结论；遗留观察项写入 followups 供后续定义摄入。完成后写 `cleanup-report.md`；最终回复只输出本节点 schema 对应 JSON。",
      "output": {
        "outcomePath": "$.status",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "status": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "DELIVERED"
              ]
            },
            "summary": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "followups": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "status",
            "summary",
            "followups"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "files": {
          "cleanup-report.md": "markdown"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "diagnose",
      "to": "fix",
      "outcome": "DIAGNOSED"
    },
    {
      "from": "diagnose",
      "to": "$end",
      "outcome": "BLOCKED"
    },
    {
      "from": "diagnose",
      "to": "diagnose",
      "on": "technical"
    },
    {
      "from": "fix",
      "to": "review",
      "outcome": "FIXED"
    },
    {
      "from": "fix",
      "to": "$end",
      "outcome": "BLOCKED"
    },
    {
      "from": "fix",
      "to": "fix",
      "on": "technical"
    },
    {
      "from": "review",
      "to": "regression",
      "outcome": "APPROVE"
    },
    {
      "from": "review",
      "to": "fix",
      "outcome": "FIX_ISSUES",
      "countRound": true
    },
    {
      "from": "review",
      "to": "diagnose",
      "outcome": "ROOT_CAUSE_REFUTED",
      "countRound": true
    },
    {
      "from": "review",
      "to": "$end",
      "outcome": "BLOCKED"
    },
    {
      "from": "review",
      "to": "review",
      "on": "technical"
    },
    {
      "from": "regression",
      "to": "closeout",
      "outcome": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "from": "regression",
      "to": "fix",
      "outcome": "FIX_ISSUES",
      "countRound": true
    },
    {
      "from": "regression",
      "to": "diagnose",
      "outcome": "ROOT_CAUSE_REFUTED",
      "countRound": true
    },
    {
      "from": "regression",
      "to": "$end",
      "outcome": "BLOCKED"
    },
    {
      "from": "regression",
      "to": "regression",
      "on": "technical"
    },
    {
      "from": "closeout",
      "to": "$end",
      "outcome": "DELIVERED"
    },
    {
      "from": "closeout",
      "to": "closeout",
      "on": "technical"
    }
  ],
  "bindings": {
    "models": {
      "diagnose": {
        "provider": "deepseek-official",
        "model": "deepseek-flash"
      },
      "fix": {
        "provider": "deepseek-official",
        "model": "deepseek-flash"
      },
      "review": {
        "provider": "deepseek-official",
        "model": "deepseek-v4-flash"
      },
      "regression": {
        "provider": "deepseek-official",
        "model": "deepseek-v4-flash"
      },
      "closeout": {
        "provider": "deepseek-official",
        "model": "deepseek-flash"
      }
    }
  }
}
